              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Carla Daley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "here’s a photo of the ingredients I used. The habanero hot sauce was increased to 1 tsp; and both that and the fireweed hot honey are from Juneau Alaska :-). My hubs says it’s got a good kick. I’m bringing it to book club with corn dog bites.",
